<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R12 ha entità a cui si riferisce"@it .
_:Nb01cd62f33c64772b3df29a7f361ba89 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object> .
_:N69859e2d3dc746488197ccfd66599050 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
_:Naf6f3e79b5374794b07db832b61b46ee <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it identifies the hypotextual entity of an intertextual relation: the whole expression or, when the relation can be localised, a specific passage of the hypotext. The original property has domain intro:INT3_Interrelation and range the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage."@en .
_:N9bab0dcc88ca4a4f856281663f42f820 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R12 has referred to entity"@en .
